      <title>微软2026年推Excel Copilot Canvas：工作簿数据一键变交互仪表板</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260905/%E5%BE%AE%E8%BD%AF2026%E5%B9%B4%E6%8E%A8Excel-Copilot-Canvas%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E7%B0%BF%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%80%E9%94%AE%E5%8F%98%E4%BA%A4%E4%BA%92%E4%BB%AA%E8%A1%A8%E6%9D%BF/</link>
